==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=welfare}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|ang}} ''wel faran'' "wellness" (cognate with {{etyl|non}} ''[[velferð]]'')

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈwɛlˌfɛə/}}, {{SAMPA|/"wEl%fE@/}}
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈwɛlˌfɛɚ/}}, {{SAMPA|/"wEl%fE@`/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# {{uncountable}} [[health]], [[happiness]] and [[prosperity]]; well-being in any respect
# {{uncountable}} various forms of [[financial]] aid provided by the [[government]] to those who are in need of it
====Antonyms====
* [[wofare]]

